{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01516","headline":"琴曲歌辞 湘妃怨 · 孟郊","name":"琴曲歌辞 湘妃怨","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"南巡竟不返，帝子怨逾积。\n万里丧蛾眉，潇湘水空碧。\n冥冥荒山下，古庙收贞魄。\n乔木深青春，清光满瑶席。\n搴芳徒有荐，灵意殊脉脉。\n玉佩不可亲，裴回烟波夕。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孟郊","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_01516.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01516","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}